OL,3,AMel Stride and Priti Patel replaced in
OL,4,Amajor Tory reshuffle
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Mel Stride and Dame Priti Patel
OL,7,Fhave left the shadow cabinet as part of
OL,8,Fa significant reshuffle of the
OL,9,FConservative top team by leader Kemi
OL,10,FBadenoch.
OL,12,FAndrew Griffith will replace Sir Mel as
OL,13,Fshadow chancellor, while Tom Tugendhat
OL,14,Fwill take the place of Dame Priti as
OL,15,Fshadow foreign secretary.
OL,17,FBadenoch is forming a new shadow
OL,18,Fcabinet before the party's conference
OL,19,Fin October.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
