OL,3,AMel Stride and Priti Patel replaced in
OL,4,Amajor Tory reshuffle
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith most polls putting the
OL,7,FConservatives in third place, lagging
OL,8,Fbehind Labour and Reform UK, the Tory
OL,9,Fleader will be hoping a refreshed
OL,10,Fshadow cabinet will help boost to her
OL,11,Fparty's popularity.
